    </div>
    <div style="background:#1a0f2e;border:1px solid #4c1d95;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:12px;color:#c084fc">
      Vai distribuir <strong>${dealIds.length} cliente(s)</strong> em round-robin entre as operadoras marcadas abaixo.
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:11px;color:#888">
      <span>Selecione quem participa:</span>
      <span>
        <button onclick="distToggleAll(true)" style="background:#1e3a5f;color:#7cb9f5;border:1px solid #5ba3f5;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:10px;cursor:pointer">Marcar todos</button>
        <button onclick="distToggleAll(false)" style="background:#1a1a1a;color:#aaa;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:10px;cursor:pointer">Desmarcar</button>
      </span>
